SUMMARY:Atlanta Black Restaurant Week 2026
DESCRIPTION:« All Events\n 				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	BBQ & Brews				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n		\n			August 8\n\n	\n\n	  @  \n\n\n6:00 PM\n\n		\n\n\n\n	\n	  -  \n\n8:00 PM\n\n\n\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n									BBQ\, Brews & School Pride!Rep your school\, enjoy delicious BBQ\, grab Stella swag\, and enter to win MEAC/SWAC Challenge tickets! Join us for an unforgettable BBQ & Brews celebration during Black Restaurant Week\, in partnership with ATL Airport District and Stella Artois! Enjoy mouthwatering BBQ\, ice-cold Stella Artois\, great vibes\, and fellowship with the community. Stop by the Stella Artois Airstream for complimentary swag and beer (21+)\, and don’t miss your chance to win exciting prizes—including a giveaway from ATL Airport District for tickets to the Cricket MEAC/SWAC Challenge Kick-Off Presented by Toyota! Rep Ya SchoolRep your favorite college\, university\, or school by wearing your gear. Whether you’re rocking HBCU pride\, your alma mater\, or your current school\, we want to see your school spirit! 								\n				\n				\n				\n									\n					\n						\n									RSVP\n					\n					\n				\n								\n				\n				\n				\n																														\n				\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n\n	Categories:	\n		Atlanta	\n\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n	\n	Add to calendar	\n		\n	\n\n		\n			\n									\n	Google Calendar\n\n									\n	iCalendar\n\n									\n	Outlook 365\n\n									\n	Outlook Live\n\n							\n		\n\n		\n	\n\n				\n				\n					\n		\n				\n			\n						\n				\n					\n				\n				\n	\n			\n		Pit Boss BBQ			\n	\n	\n	\n\n800 Doug Davis Drive\n	\n		\n		Hapeville\,\n\n	GA\n\n	30354\n\n	United States\n\n\n\n\n	+ Google Map \n\n\n	\n					\n						\n	 \n\n\n	\n	 \n\n\n\n	\n\n		\n	\n				\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n				Dining in the District	\n\n\n		\n	\n		Sunday Funday at The Works
URL:https://blackrestaurantweeks.com/event/atlanta-black-restaurant-week-2026/
LOCATION:GA
CATEGORIES:Atlanta
